    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="40.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 40.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ beton ðam kyninge swa hit gebyrige, oððe he ða dæde wrece swyðe deope.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And such compensation as is fitting shall be paid to the king, or he shall avenge the deed to the uttermost.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ bete man þæm cingce, swa hit gebyrige, oððe he ða dæde wrece swiþe deope.</ab>
      </div>
